  "description": "Enhance your outdoor equipment with YITAMOTOR’s 16x6.5-8 4-ply tires! This set of 2 heavy-duty tires is designed for lawn mowers, garden tractors, golf carts, motorcycles, and farm equipment. Offers superior traction, durability, and all-terrain performance.\nFeatures\nSpecifications: Tire Size: 16X6.50-8\", Tire Load Range: B/4PR/4Ply, Side Wall: 2Ply, Tread Depth: 0.27\"/7.1mm, Rim Width: 5.37\", Section Width: 6.4\"/165mm, Outer Diameter: 15.99\"/410mm, Max Load: 620lbs@28psi\nHigh Performance: Unique tread pattern design reduces lawn damage by increasing friction between the tire and ground; Also reduces tire noise and enhances the tire’s cooling and drainage capability to improve overall vehicle handling\nCompatibility: Our 16X6.50-8\" lawn mower tires are compatible with lawn mowers, riding lawn mowers, lawn tractors, and garden tractors\nPackage: Includes set of 2 16X6.50-8\" lawn mower tires that are suitable for lawnmowers, motorcycles, garden tractors, golf carts, and farm equipment\nNote: Before purchasing, please check the size of your existing tire's sidewall, rim, and tread depth to ensure proper fit; Our team is ready to assist with any questions",
